│    WELCOME TO MTM                                                          ▐│
│  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────                    ▐│
│                                                                             ││
│  MTM is your terminal task manager: keyboard-first, Pomodoro-native, with a ││
│  calendar, a kanban board, courses/exams, and a heatmap so you can see your ││
│  rhythm.                                                                    ││
│  Open this guide anytime with  7 ,  :guide  in the palette, or  mtm guide   ││
│  at launch.                                                                 ││
│  Close it with  esc  or  q . Switch sections with  1 - 9  or  h / l ;       ││
│  scroll with  j / k .                                                       ││
│  One task done beats ten planned.                                           ││
│                                                                             ││
